## DEFERRED

- Mainnet upgrade of `btc_table_1` (and the rest of the fleet) with this fix: operator lane. Covered by the already-queued 1790632499 ("The six mainnet backends run one reproducible build, and check-fleet-coherence exits 0", `lane: operator`, `after: 1790632453`), which redeploys all six backends from a clean main with `IDENTITY=<operator's mainnet identity> ./scripts/deploy-mainnet.sh`. No duplicate filed. Until it runs, `notify_deposit` on `btc_table_1` stays as it is today: a dead door (E-105), so the double credit is not reachable on the shipped module, but ckBTC sent to the table's main account cannot be credited either.

